## Quick Reference

| Task | MCP | Tool |
|------|-----|------|
| Fix errors on page | next-devtools | nextjs_call → get_errors |
| Next.js API question | next-devtools | nextjs_docs |
| Audit structure / Next.js compliance | next-devtools | nextjs_index + nextjs_docs |
| Supabase auth/SSR help | supabase | search_docs |
| Add shadcn component | shadcn | search_items_in_registries → get_add_command_for_items |
| Inspect app structure | next-devtools | nextjs_index (dev server must be running) |
